meta {
  name: Get Game Time To Beat
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{backendUrl}}/api/games/141503/time-to-beat
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  IGDB's own beat-time data (hastily/normally/completely, in seconds) by
  game id. 141503 = Elden Ring. If IGDB has no entry for a game, "Search
  Games (Enriched)" falls back to HowLongToBeat instead. Run auth/Login
  first.

  503 if neither the caller nor the server has IGDB credentials
  configured, or if IGDB is unreachable.
}
